"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":12,"created_at":"2025-05-11T05:29:46Z","updated_at":"2025-07-14T04:14:21Z","closed_at":"2025-05-22T17:22:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106267","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106267","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106267.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106267.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-22T17:22:10Z"},"body":"Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102352\r\nFixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/18320\r\n\r\nWhen Android users go into the developer options and enable \"Force 4x MSAA\", Android forces us to allocate a 4X MSAA backbuffer. It happens automatically and we can't stop it, despite it being a complete waste of resources. \r\n\r\nUnfortunately the common advice on the internet for Android gamers is that they _should always_ enable \"Force 4x MSAA\" (for example, this horrifying Quora post https://www.quora.com/Is-it-safe-to-turn-on-the-Force-4x-MSAA-on-Android?top_ans=105185416). So many Android gamers are activating developer mode (despite the numerous warnings that Android gives saying not to) and turning on the setting. \r\n\r\nCurrently we blit our internal framebuffer to the main backbuffer. However, `glBlitFramebuffer` only works if you are blitting from a multisampled texture into a non-multisampled texture, or if the number of samples is the same between the two. By enabling \"Force 4x MSAA\" we can end up blitting from a non MSAA texture into a 4X MSAA texture, which fails. \r\n\r\nFortunately, the workaround is very easy and not harmful for performance. We just use a fragment shader to copy over the texture. This has the benefit of working for any sample count and isn't more expensive than blitting. \r\n\r\nCC @dsnopek The only part I am unsure about is the texture copy for Multiview. I believe what I have should work fine for WebXR, but can you check and make sure?","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106267/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":6,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106267/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}